{
  "crate": "crates/wormhole-core",
  "domains": [
    {
      "name": "platform",
      "tier": 0,
      "new": true,
      "doc": [
        "Core's edge to the operating system: the quit signal (`quit_signal`), the editors and apps a file",
        "can be opened in (`open_in`) and how one opens a file at a line (`open_file`). Core's other OS code",
        "moves here in time; the app's own edge is its `platform` module.",
        "",
        "The lowest tier: nothing here uses another domain of core."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "storage",
      "tier": 0,
      "new": true,
      "doc": [
        "Where Wormhole keeps its data and how it is read and written: the data folder's layout and the",
        "profile id that names a folder in it (`paths`), files read with a cap and written atomically",
        "(`fsutil`), JSONC files (`jsonc`) and the SQLite database (`store`).",
        "",
        "The lowest tier: nothing here uses another domain of core. The store never reads settings or",
        "talks to the running app; what it saves comes to it as values."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "keys",
      "tier": 0,
      "new": true,
      "doc": [
        "Keys: a shortcut as text (`keyspec`), every action's keys, the menus and the shortcut sheet as one",
        "table (`keymap`), and recording a shortcut in Settings (`shortcut_record`).",
        "",
        "The lowest tier: nothing here uses another domain of core."
      ]
    },
    {"name": "theme", "tier": 1, "new": false},
    {"name": "agents", "tier": 1, "new": false},
    {"name": "update", "tier": 1, "new": false},
    {
      "name": "view",
      "tier": 2,
      "new": true,
      "doc": [
        "What the app's views show, as data and rules without GPUI: the sidebar's list (`sidebar`), the",
        "columns, title row and status bar (`layout`), split panes (`panes`), where focus goes between",
        "areas (`focus`), the command palette's matching (`search`), VoiceOver's words (`spoken`), the",
        "panel's tabs (`panel`), drag and drop order (`reorder`), shortened text (`elide`), the panels'",
        "caps and counts (`limits`) and the title row's extras (`title_extras`).",
        "",
        "It uses only `theme` below it: never settings, git, the store or the running app. What those know",
        "comes to it as values."
      ]
    },
    {"name": "project", "tier": 2, "new": false},
    {"name": "config", "tier": 3, "new": false},
    {"name": "git", "tier": 4, "new": false},
    {"name": "notify", "tier": 4, "new": false},
    {"name": "ipc", "tier": 5, "new": false},
    {"name": "terminal", "tier": 6, "new": false},
    {"name": "onboarding", "tier": 7, "new": false}
  ],
  "modules": [
    {"old": "quit_signal", "new": "platform::quit_signal", "path": "platform/quit_signal.rs"},
    {"old": "open_in", "new": "platform::open_in", "path": "platform/open_in.rs"},
    {"old": "open_file", "new": "platform::open_file", "path": "platform/open_file.rs"},
    {"old": "fsutil", "new": "storage::fsutil", "path": "storage/fsutil/mod.rs"},
    {"old": "jsonc", "new": "storage::jsonc", "path": "storage/jsonc/mod.rs"},
    {"old": "text", "new": "storage::jsonc::suggest", "path": "storage/jsonc/suggest.rs", "vis": "pub(crate)"},
    {"old": "store", "new": "storage::store", "path": "storage/store/mod.rs"},
    {"old": "paths", "new": "storage::paths", "path": "storage/paths.rs"},
    {"old": "keymap", "new": "keys::keymap", "path": "keys/keymap/mod.rs"},
    {"old": "keyspec", "new": "keys::keyspec", "path": "keys/keyspec.rs"},
    {"old": "shortcut_record", "new": "keys::shortcut_record", "path": "keys/shortcut_record.rs"},
    {"old": "theme", "new": "theme", "path": "theme/mod.rs"},
    {"old": "tokens", "new": "theme::tokens", "path": "theme/tokens/mod.rs"},
    {"old": "color", "new": "theme::tokens::color", "path": "theme/tokens/color.rs", "vis": "",
     "vis_during_move": "pub(crate)"},
    {"old": "theme_registry", "new": "theme::registry", "path": "theme/registry.rs"},
